# The build COPIES assets/ into dist/ and Cloudflare serves those bytes verbatim, so a
# checkout that converts line endings produces a site that differs from production.
# The deployed assets are LF. Force LF in the working tree so `python build.py` is
# reproducible on any machine.
#
# Generated HTML is written by build.py through write_text(), which emits the platform
# newline; production HTML is CRLF and that is expected. Only tracked sources are pinned here.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.blend binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
